  "title": "My head hurts",
  "goal": "Spot the words that lose a vowel before a suffix: ağzım, burnum, oğlum, ismim.",
  "points": ["gp-vowel-loss", "gp-possessive-suffixes"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Some words lose their last vowel before a suffix that starts with a vowel: *ağız* (mouth) → *ağzım*, *burun* (nose) → *burnum*, *oğul* (son) → *oğlum*, *isim* (name) → *ismim*. Before a consonant they stay whole: *şehirde*.",
    "see": "gp-vowel-loss"
  },
